(text "AC METERING. Hot side GND_AC (isolated by ADuM5020 + 2x ADuM141E). Voltage: 4x1M (HV 1206) / 1k per phase = 4001:1, 1k/33nF anti-alias.\nCurrent: AC1005 1000:1 CT on PCB, external CT secondaries looped through (P1/P2), burden 2x24.9R centre-tapped. GEN_N and BUS_N both tied to GND_AC (open question).\nADuM5020 is 3kVrms basic - NOT the 5kV reinforced in spec." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3cff6087-9c6d-447f-b4b7-82df04712757"))
)
